<!--
    Brazilian Portuguese, and deliberately the plain `pt` bucket rather than `pt-rBR`: a device whose
    system language is just "Português" reports locale `pt` with no region, and Android never matches
    a `-rBR` folder against a region-less locale. Keeping the Brazilian text here means `pt` and
    `pt-BR` both land on it; European Portuguese lives in values-pt-rPT and wins for `pt-PT`.
-->
